Choke: moti copper wire ki coil jo soft iron laminated core par bohat se turns mein qareeb qareeb lapeti jati hai.

Model: choke ko series RL circuit samjha jata hai: bohat kam qeemat ka resistor R, bari inductive reactance X_L = 2πfL wale inductor L ke series mein. Iron core ki zyada permeability (magnetic guzargahi) ki wajah se L bohat zyada hoti hai.

Power kyun zaya nahi hoti: series RL mein P = I²R = VI cos θ, aur tan θ = ωL/R. Choke ki R bohat kam aur ωL bohat zyada hai, is liye θ taqreeban 90° aur power factor cos θ taqreeban zero. Is liye amalan koi power hararat mein zaya nahi hoti; inductor energy magnetic field mein store karke wapas kar deta hai.

Istemal:
(i) zyada frequency AC ko rokna, DC aur kam frequency AC ko guzarna;
(ii) electronic circuits se zyada frequency ka AC noise saaf karna, saaf DC output;
(iii) switch-mode power supplies mein voltage regulate karna aur switching noise saaf karna;
(iv) RF signals ko circuit se bahar nikalne se rokna;
(v) fluorescent lights mein tube par transient voltages paida karna taake gas ka breakdown ho;
(vi) current ki tabdeeli ki raftaar mehdood karke insulation ko surges se bachana.

Impedance diagram mein X_L = ωL aur X_C = 1/ωC aik doosre ke mukhalif hain, is liye kul reactance X_L − X_C hai:
Z = √(R² + (X_L − X_C)²) ... (17.24)
Z = √(R² + (ωL − 1/ωC)²) ... (17.25)

Zyada frequency: X_L ≫ X_C, inductive reactance ghalib, circuit RL-series jaisa.
Kam frequency: X_C ≫ X_L, capacitive reactance ghalib, circuit RC-series jaisa.

Resonance: in ke darmiyan aik frequency ωᵣ par X_L = X_C; barabar aur mukhalif reactances khatam ho jati hain aur circuit khaalis resistive ban jata hai. Shart lagane se:
X_L = X_C
ωᵣL = 1/ωᵣC
ωᵣ² = 1/LC
ωᵣ = 1/√LC; ωᵣ = 2πfᵣ se
2πfᵣ = 1/√LC
fᵣ = 1/(2π√LC) ... (17.26)

Resonance par khoobiyan:
(i) impedance kam se kam, Z = R;
(ii) current zyada se zyada;
(iii) phase angle zero, power factor 1;
(iv) resistor damping deta hai; zyada R, jaldi khatam (car ke shock absorber ki tarah);
(v) radio receivers mein tuning aur band-pass filter;
(vi) voltage amplification: L aur C par voltage applied voltage se kahin zyada ho sakta hai;
(vii) true power P = VI cos θ (17.27) θ = 0 par zyada se zyada.
